  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7b283696-cdb1-4f0c-8e8d-1f07161e1d43.png\"></p><p>區塊活動追蹤器是一個簡單的函式庫模組，用於追蹤每個區塊的玩家活動資訊，主要是記錄玩家在各區塊停留的時間。</p><p>此模組本身不具備獨立功能，但為模組開發者提供實用工具。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4d4ecfc0-0b86-4da7-8e41-c57dc2225ae3.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ChunkActivityTracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a3f2a006-916c-43df-b703-a2e332f070c8.png\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">功能特色：</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">追蹤每位玩家在各區塊停留的秒數</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">記錄每位玩家在各區塊放置的方塊數量</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">可選擇性儲存每個區塊的原始未修改高度圖資料以供後續參考</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">採用最佳化的二進位儲存格式，在存檔資料夾中按維度簡單儲存（經過10萬個區塊的壓力測試）</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
